From 12aa5508f06d078f6735116df11ae219ad3105f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:09:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/systemtray: allow manually reordering icons

Tray icons were always sorted by category, with no way to put them in
the order you want. The Entries page now has a manual order mode where
entries can be dragged or moved with the keyboard, plus a reset action.

BUG: 384782
